From 8330811f290812b7621a84afc568430d5826fc73 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Maeve Sproule <code@sprock.dev>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 17:39:47 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] Skip libxml2.14-dependent test_clean.txt doctest

The parsing algorithm was changed in libxml2.14 which, among other changes,
caused control characters to be preserved. As a result, lxml_html_clean updated
this example to expect that control characters are preserved, but libxml2 has
not yet been updated past v2.13.x in void-packages because of the breaking
changes introduced in subsequent versions. lxml_html_clean does not rely on the
v2.14+ behaviour, otherwise.
---
 tests/test_clean.txt | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/tests/test_clean.txt b/tests/test_clean.txt
index 227935b..487ed0f 100644
--- a/tests/test_clean.txt
+++ b/tests/test_clean.txt
@@ -68,7 +68,7 @@
   </body>
 </html>
 
->>> print(tostring(fromstring(doc)).decode("utf-8"))
+>>> print(tostring(fromstring(doc)).decode("utf-8")) # doctest: +SKIP
 <html>
   <head>
     <script type="text/javascript" src="evil-site"></script>
-- 
2.56.1

